Bound AIC register accesses to the handoff-declared MMIO aperture.

Keep the existing AIC1 fixed window, AIC2 fallbacks, AIC3 scalar metadata
contracts and event-hook size. Preflight both capability reads and IACK,
require the existing whole-word IRQ-bank layout, bound each indexed register
bank and validate public software-IRQ/offset ingress. Cast before die-stride
multiplication. These are offline arithmetic/metadata contracts, not proof
of physical register availability, power state, routing or native boot.

--- a/src/aic.c
+++ b/src/aic.c
@@ -45,6 +45,22 @@
 
 struct aic *aic;
 
+/* Declared ADT register aperture, separate from the HV event-hook size. */
+static u64 aic_aperture;
+
+static bool aic_range(u64 offset, u64 size)
+{
+    return aic && !(offset & 3) && offset <= aic_aperture &&
+           size <= aic_aperture - offset;
+}
+
+static bool aic_bank_range(u64 offset, u32 stride, u64 size)
+{
+    if ((stride & 3) || (aic->nr_die > 1 && stride < size))
+        return false;
+    return aic_range(offset + (u64)(aic->nr_die - 1) * stride, size);
+}
